  "description": "Premium React Rich Text Editor SDK with First-Class Tables, 2D Color Picker, Bubble Menu & Zero Dependencies. Fast alternative to TipTap, Quill, Lexical & Slate for Next.js, React 18/19 & Laravel Inertia.",
